    scho:identifier "d1e4c8a9" ;
    scho:name "Handwritten Lyrics for 'Wonderwall'" ;
    scho:description "Noel Gallagher's original handwritten lyrics for 'Wonderwall', written on a sheet of hotel stationery in 1995. Includes crossed-out lines and annotations." ;
    scho:caption "The draft of a generation-defining anthem. These handwritten lyrics by Noel Gallagher capture the raw emotion and introspection that made 'Wonderwall' an enduring classic of the Britpop era. Written during a stay at the Midland Hotel in Manchester, they offer a glimpse into the creative process behind one of Oasis's most beloved songs." ;
    scho:category wd:Q49848 ;
