    scho:name "BRIT Award for British Album of the Year (2012)" ;
    scho:description "The BRIT Award trophy presented to Adele for her album '21' at the 2012 ceremony. The statue for that year was designed by Sir Peter Blake." ;
    scho:caption "A physical recognition of a record-breaking album. Adele's '21' became the best-selling album of the 21st century in the UK, and this BRIT Award trophy symbolizes her monumental achievement in British music history." ;
